{"title":"Skeleton Man-at-Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 36 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (15.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>46</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>38</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>65</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>20</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>39</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>46</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>38</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>65</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>38</b></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>20</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>39</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 11 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 11 looted corpses, 177 recorded drops, 10,031 total, 21–146 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 27% of 11 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 19 total, 5–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">27% · 3/11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 27% of 11 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">27% · 3/11</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 18% of 11 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">18% · 2/11</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 7 total, 7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 1/11</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-legs\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Legs - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d665ef86050cc2f37c8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 1/11</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-head\" title=\"Gold Head - in 9% of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src